<title>JAPAN: Chugai to tie up with Merck on health care.</title>
<headline>Chugai to tie up with Merck on health care.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Chugai Pharmaceutical Co Ltd said on Friday that it would tie up with Merck and Co Ltd of the United States in the field of health care.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
